## Third-party code / 第三方代码说明

This repository contains only the files we modified or added. Other parts
depend on the following projects, whose copyright belongs to their
respective owners:

- **xiaozhi-esp32** (https://github.com/78/xiaozhi-esp32) — MIT License.
  The board adaptation layer and application framework are based on it.
- **ESP-SR** by Espressif Systems (https://github.com/espressif/esp-sr) —
  the offline speech recognition models are provided under Espressif's
  own license terms; they are NOT included in this repository.
- **Hiwonder** hardware example code — the peripheral drivers under
  `firmware/main/boards/HiwonderExploit_S3/` (`motor.c/h`, `qmi8658.c/h`,
  `ultrasound.c/h`, `xl9555.c/h`) are adapted from vendor example code.
  Please verify their licensing terms before redistributing.
  The `bench/` and `docs/` directories are fully independent of vendor code.
